KNOWNBUG
main.c
--arrays-uf-always --no-simplify
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
^Invariant check failed
--
With --arrays-uf-always and --no-simplify, a write to an array member of a
struct fails an invariant in arrayst::add_array_constraints ("unexpected array
expression (add_array_constraints): 'member'"). Without --no-simplify, the
assertion is proved.
